      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Few of these clashed last time. DON TURBOAS (1) missed narrowly over a mile here two back then got way too far back last time but stormed home for a close-up fourth to HONEST WARRIOR. No better off at the wrights but looks ideally suited out further in trip and will be tough to stop. HONEST WARRIOR (2) won that race and also came from well off the pace. Senior rider aboard again and looks like the extra ground will suit. Can measure up again. REGAL HUNTER (3) has been thereabouts without winning but gets the senior rider go aboard this time. Has more upside than most and expected to feature. THEM'S THE BREAKS (5) kept coming and just missed last time behind HONEST WARRIOR. Meets the winner 2kg better so is a live chance to turn the tables. LAST TREMBLE (4) has been freshened since finishing fourth last time and looks a chance on best form.",
